{"id":"n24095-1-9","stage":4,"title":"의원 · 议员","scene":"制度与公共事务","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24095-1-9-1","ko":"우리 할아버지께서는 국회 의원을 지내신 분이세요.","zh":"我们的祖父曾经是国会议员。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"할아버지께서는","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지께서는","audio":"/audio/0d517ae379cfaa18c6c4.mp3"}},{"text":"국회","meaning":"国会","explanation":"국회：国会","readings":[{"term":"국회","audio":"/audio/6b3c3813c1a5afe032e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36856","senseId":"1","lemma":"국회","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"국회","audio":"/audio/6b3c3813c1a5afe032e9.mp3"}},{"text":"의원을","meaning":"议员","explanation":"의원：议员；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"의원","audio":"/audio/1ebaf194e7803d390a11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24095","senseId":"1","lemma":"의원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"의원을","audio":"/audio/b40d89597956837370e0.mp3"}},{"text":"지내신","meaning":"当","explanation":"지내다：当；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"3","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내신","audio":"/audio/6d2ef7e8795c4e2a4cd8.mp3"}},{"text":"분이세요.","meaning":"位","explanation":"분：位；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"분","audio":"/audio/ca4a187881dbf529d05e.mp3"}],"